//www.zhongyifangji.com"],"safety_source":"American Dragon (Dr. Joel Penner), Zhongyifangji.com (HKBU), CloudTCM & 2026 NCBAHM Outline","exact_source_url":"https://www.americandragon.com","source_type":"sourced_cloudtcm_record","review_status":"sourced_cloudtcm_record","public_safe":true,"fetched_at":"2026-07-23","tags_fetched_at":"2026-07-23","safety_fetched_at":"2026-07-23","aliases_zh":[],"condition_tags_zh":["涼血止血清熱利尿"],"related_formulas":["formula.yin_qiao_san","formula.sang_ju_yin","formula.shi_hui_san","formula.zhu_ling_tang","formula.bai_he_gu_jin_tang","formula.gan_lu_xiao_du_dan"],"category":"止血藥 / Stop Bleeding","american_dragon_url":"https://www.americandragon.com/Individualherbsupdate/BaiMaoGen.html","american_dragon_link_status":"derived","atlas_url":"https://chinesemedicineatlas.com/tcm_herb_atlas/","atlas_link_status":"index","field_sources":{},"card_grade":"partial"},{"id":"herb.bai_fu_zi","name_zh":"白附子","name_en":"Giant Typhonium Rhizome","pinyin":"Bai Fu Zi","category_zh":"溫化寒痰藥","taste_temperature_zh":"辛, 甘, 溫, 有毒","channels_zh":["胃經","肝經"],"functions_zh":["燥濕化痰","祛風止痙","解毒散結","止痛"],"indications_zh":["風痰阻絡、頭面部病證 —— 口眼歪斜、面癱、偏頭痛、半身不遂。","風痰閉阻、筋脈拘急 —— 癲癇、驚風、破傷風痙攣。","痰核瘰癧、毒蛇咬傷 —— 炮製品內服或生品適量外用。","偏正頭痛、眩暈而屬風痰者 —— 常配川芎、白芷等。"],"cautions_zh":["本品有毒，內服必須使用炮製品並嚴格控制劑量。","過量可引起口舌咽喉麻木腫脹、噁心嘔吐、心悸或呼吸困難。"],"study_tags":["單味中藥","國考大綱","順天堂藥材","溫化寒痰藥","白附子"],"source_urls":["https://cloudtcm.com/herb/1772","https://www.americandragon.com/Individualherbsupdate/ZhiBaiFuZi.html","https://traditional-worldmedicine.com/baifuzi/","https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E7%99%BD%E9%99%84%E5%AD%90"],"cloudtcm_url":"https://cloudtcm.com/herb/1772","safety_source":"Chenoweth p.32; American Dragon Zhi Bai Fu Zi","exact_source_url":"https://www.americandragon.com/Individualherbsupdate/ZhiBaiFuZi.html","source_type":"source_transcribed","review_status":"draft","public_safe":false,"fetched_at":"2026-07-23","tags_fetched_at":"2026-07-23","safety_fetched_at":"2026-07-23","aliases_zh":[],"condition_tags_zh":["面癱口歪","風痰頭痛","半身不遂","癲癇驚風","破傷風痙攣","痰核瘰癧"],"condition_tags_en":["Facial paralysis","Wind-Phlegm headache","Hemiplegia","Epilepsy and convulsions","Tetanus spasms","Phlegm nodules and scrofula"],"actions_en":["Dry Dampness and transform Phlegm","Dispel Wind and stop spasms","Resolve toxicity and dissipate nodules","Relieve pain"],"modern_functions_zh":["抗驚厥作用","鎮靜作用","鎮痛作用","抗發炎作用","抗菌作用","抗腫瘤作用"],"modern_functions_en":["Anticonvulsant activity","Sedative activity","Analgesic activity","Anti-inflammatory activity","Antibacterial activity","Antitumor activity"],"pharmaceutical_latin":"Typhonii Rhizoma preparatum","part_used_en":"Prepared rhizome","dosage":{"decoction_g":"Chenoweth：3–5g，重症可至 9g；American Dragon：1.5–6g；CloudTCM、Traditional World Medicine：3–6g","特殊說明":"各來源範圍並列保留。內服只用炮製品；生品僅供外用。"},"dosage_g":"1.5–9g（依來源與病情；僅限炮製品）","pao_zhi_notes_zh":["制白附子經炮製降低毒性後供內服。","生白附子毒性與刺激性較強，只供外用。"],"contraindications_zh":["孕婦禁用。","陰虛血虛動風者禁用。","內熱生驚者禁用。","生白附子不得內服。"],"contraindications_en":["Contraindicated during pregnancy.","Contraindicated for Internal Wind from Yin or Blood deficiency.","Contraindicated for convulsions due to Internal Heat.","Raw Bai Fu Zi must not be administered internally."],"cautions_en":["Internal use requires a professionally processed preparation and careful dosing.","Overdose may cause oral and throat numbness or swelling, nausea, vomiting, palpitations or respiratory difficulty."],"exam_importance":"★ Chenoweth：頭面風痰要藥，尤其口眼歪斜、面癱與風痰頭痛；對應 NCBAHM 2026 CH Domain I.A。","exam_pearl":"重點不是一般肺痰，而是「頭面風痰＋止痙」；有毒，內服必須炮製，生品只外用。","clinical_use_note":"學習辨識：白附子的核心定位是「頭面風痰＋止痙止痛」，特別留意口眼歪斜、面癱、偏頭痛及風痰驚搐；這與偏治濕痰、降逆止嘔的半夏，以及偏治頑痰、風痰痙厥的天南星不同。常與白僵蠶、全蠍同用以祛風化痰、通絡止痙。安全記憶點是「有毒、內服必須用制品、生品只外用」，且孕婦與陰虛血虛動風者禁用。","source_citations":[{"name":"Chenoweth Materia Medica 課件","scope":"p.32：性味歸經、功效、主治、劑量、炮製與禁忌"},{"name":"雲端中醫 CloudTCM・白附子","url":"https://cloudtcm.com/herb/1772","scope":"精確單味藥頁與圖像；交叉支持英文名、獨角蓮基原、性味歸經、功效、3–6g 劑量、炮製安全、禁忌及現代藥理。頁面中另一段異質基原敘述未採用"},{"name":"American Drago